If the boulder is in the row with the pits, you want to kill the
monsters so you can use the buolder to fill the pit.  If it in
in the row after the pits, you want to 1) figure out how the
boulder got there (or is it a mimic) so you don't make that
mistake again, and 2) figure out what you did to wake up
all of th emonsters so you don't make that mistake again.
Far better to arrive in that room with them all asleep so you
can dispatch them one by one carefully chosing the ones that
don't make noise and finally taking out the few noisy ones last.

